      text About danger
      h1 What’s new in v2?
      text Pico v2.0 features better accessibility, easier customization with SASS, a complete color palette, a new group component, and 20 precompiled color themes totaling over 100 combinations accessible via CDN.
    col
      text Content
      link "New look and feel" /docs/v2
